_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957870/extras/177fa67884a50a121196f37e9f5a3981.poster.avif?t=1761241939\" width=630 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957870/extras/177fa67884a50a121196f37e9f5a3981.webm?t=1761241939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957870/extras/177fa67884a50a121196f37e9f5a3981.mp4?t=1761241939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use hexagonal tiles with elemental resources (fire, water, wood, stone, and air) to cast powerful spells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the environment to your advantage by manipulating the natural elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast devastating spells to overcome foul creatures and obstacles in your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your moves in strategic turn-based combat to outwit enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new spell cards for endless strategic possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a cursed land and encounter mysterious figures on your journey.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Catilian Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957870/34fc7a12a0fdaabbc3a2eee4427a26700c9ba629/header.jpg?t=1761241939","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2957870/1421253793/29e763d49ff7ba961c6b9d83d5ed1ed7dcc25c9e/17